  "note": "The adversarial shape that breaks the ordered leak query: t1 reads the untrusted feed and the private store into the shared memo m; t2..t40 each read m and write the public sink. Walk cycles re-enter the context, so the route count explodes and the ordered LEAK_PATH dies at the server budget. scan falls back to LEAK_PATH_FAST (arbitrary order, exact count); the cut is unaffected."
